flowchart TD
  Store[Store POS] --> Provisional[Create provisional ID]
  Provisional --> Local[Continue offline sale]
  Local --> Edge[Encrypted local outbox]
  Edge --> Hub[Retry idempotent upsert]
  Hub --> MDM[Customer MDM]
  MDM --> Check{High confidence and no conflict?}
  Check -->|Yes| Map[Enterprise ID and crosswalk]
  Check -->|No| Steward[Steward review queue]
  Steward --> Decision{Approve merge?}
  Decision -->|Yes| Map
  Decision -->|No| Keep[Keep separate identities]
  Map --> Update[Local cache updated on reconnect]
